
# Add viswa to the sudo group (recommended)
sudo usermod -aG wheel viswa

# Verify:
groups viswa

# You should see: viswa : viswa wheel





To remove viswa from sudo group
===============================

# you can remove viswa from the wheel group with:
sudo gpasswd -d viswa wheel

# Example output: Removing user viswa from group wheel

# Verify that viswa is no longer in the wheel group:
groups viswa

# Expected output: any other groups except wheel
